# The cg26o options are the build's own defaults: closed-form edits with the
# growth cap 1.5, at least 16 other conclusions to centre on and 8 earlier
# edited conclusions refreshed by age in every edit, the edit decay
# diagnostic, and adaptive sleep (REM cycles at most 6).

PRESET_BUILD=threshold_lean_stagec9_7cg26o_conduit.py
